`blank private defence` MEANS `Private Defence Facts` WITH
    `defends his own body or the body of any other person` IS FALSE
    `the act defended against is an offence affecting the human body` IS FALSE
    `defends property whether movable or immovable of himself or of any other person` IS FALSE
    `the act defended against is theft robbery mischief or criminal trespass or an attempt to commit one of them` IS FALSE
