§§ `Assertions`

#ASSERT NOT (`any screened offence is indicated` `innocent act in Singapore`)
#ASSERT `any screened offence is indicated` `cheating in Singapore`
#ASSERT `the proposed act constitutes cheating` `cheating in Singapore`
#ASSERT `the proposed act constitutes section 420 cheating` `cheating in Singapore`
#ASSERT `a general exception applies` `cheating by a child of 8`
#ASSERT NOT (`the proposed act constitutes cheating` `cheating by a child of 8`)
#ASSERT `the proposed act constitutes cheating by remote communication` `remote cheating of a company`
#ASSERT `section 4B location facts are met` `remote cheating of a company`
#ASSERT `Singapore has territorial reach over the proposed act` `cheating in Singapore`

#EVAL `the offence screen of` `cheating in Singapore`
#EVAL `the offence screen of` `cheating by a child of 8`

